---
// src/pages/about-us.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | Free Seller Profit Calculator for Indian E-commerce"
  description="Learn about Seller Profit Calculator — a 100% free, privacy-first analytical suite built to help Indian marketplace sellers, D2C founders, and quick-commerce merchants master unit economics in 2026."
  canonicalPath="/about-us"
>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-white">
    <!-- Hero Banner -->
    <section class="border-b border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50/50 py-12 sm:py-16">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-200">
            About Seller Profit Calculator
          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900">
          Empowering Indian Online Sellers With True Unit Economics
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Built by e-commerce operators to help sellers, D2C founders, and marketplace brands calculate real take-home profits after hidden commissions, shipping slabs, GST, and RTO losses.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16 space-y-12 text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
      
      <!-- The Problem We Saw -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          Why We Built This Platform
        </h2>
        <p>
          Selling online in India has never been more competitive. With platforms like <strong>Amazon India, Flipkart, Meesho, Myntra, Blinkit, and Zepto</strong> continuously adjusting their referral fee percentages, closing fee slabs, courier weight thresholds, and pickup charges, calculating whether a product is truly profitable has become an operational nightmare.
        </p>
        <p>
          Most calculators online are dangerously outdated or oversimplified:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-neutral-600 text-sm">
          <li>They assume 100% of orders are delivered and completely ignore <strong>Return-to-Origin (RTO)</strong> courier burn on COD orders (typically 15%&ndash;30% in India).</li>
          <li>They overlook customer return penalty charges (₹120&ndash;₹150 reverse courier fees billed by platforms) and packaging wastage.</li>
          <li>They forget that <strong>18% GST on marketplace fees</strong> is deducted upfront from settlements (though claimable as ITC in GSTR-3B).</li>
          <li>They blur the critical difference between <em>Bank Settlement Payout</em> and <em>True Net In-Hand Profit</em>.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We created <strong>Seller Profit Calculator</strong> to solve this: giving every Indian merchant complete mathematical clarity before they spend money on stock or ad campaigns.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Key Pillars -->
      <section class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          Our Core Principles
        </h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-neutral-200 shadow-xs">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mb-3">
              1
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-1.5">100% Free Forever</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 leading-relaxed">
              No subscription tiers, no paywalls, and no mandatory sign-ups. All 21 calculators and simulators are accessible to every entrepreneur for free.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-neutral-200 shadow-xs">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mb-3">
              2
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-1.5">Strict Client-Side Privacy</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 leading-relaxed">
              Your product costs, listing prices, and sales figures are computed entirely inside your browser. We never log, store, or sell your proprietary seller data.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-neutral-200 shadow-xs">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mb-3">
              3
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-1.5">2026 Verified Slabs</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 leading-relaxed">
              Continuously benchmarked against official rate cards from Amazon India, Flipkart Seller Hub, Meesho Supplier Central, and 3PL courier aggregators.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- What We Cover -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          Complete Suite of 21 Seller Calculators
        </h2>
        <p>
          Our platform spans every critical dimension of Indian online commerce:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50/50">
            <strong class="text-neutral-900 block mb-1">Marketplace Profit Calculators</strong>
            <span class="text-neutral-500">Dedicated payout solvers for Meesho (0%), Flipkart, Amazon Easy Ship/FBA/FBM, Myntra, AJIO, Shopsy, Snapdeal, JioMart, Blinkit, and Zepto.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50/50">
            <strong class="text-neutral-900 block mb-1">Cost &amp; Profit Solvers</strong>
            <span class="text-neutral-500">Target price calculators, gross vs net margin analysis, break-even unit estimators, COGS batch aggregators, and dropshipping models.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50/50">
            <strong class="text-neutral-900 block mb-1">Shipping &amp; Return Analytics</strong>
            <span class="text-neutral-500">Doorstep RTO loss modeling, volumetric courier weight billing (L×W×H/5000), COD fee comparisons, and reverse logistics costs.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50/50">
            <strong class="text-neutral-900 block mb-1">Tax, Advertising &amp; Operations</strong>
            <span class="text-neutral-500">GST inclusive/exclusive reverse solvers, Input Tax Credit (ITC), 0.5% TCS, 0.1% TDS u/s 194-O, ROAS, ACOS, TACOS, and inventory reorder points.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <section class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-200 text-center space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">
          Ready to Calculate Your Real Margins?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 max-w-lg mx-auto">
          Explore all 21 tools or jump directly into the marketplace profit calculators to protect your bottom line.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
          <a
            href="/"
            class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-neutral-900 text-white font-medium text-xs hover:bg-neutral-800 transition"
          >
            Open Calculator &rarr;
          </a>
          <a
            href="/gst-calculator"
            class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-neutral-200 text-neutral-800 font-medium text-xs hover:bg-neutral-100 transition"
          >
            GST &amp; Tax Calculator
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
